{{! Block-diagram template for Closure-DEVS coupled models.
    Uses Mermaid `flowchart LR` (not stateDiagram-v2 — coupleds don't have phases).

    Follows resources/reference/mermaid-label-safety-flowchart.md:
    - ASCII tokens only in edge labels (no Greek glyphs)
    - no semicolons, no `:=`
    - keep edge labels short: "outPort -> inPort" reads cleanly
    - wrap the coupled boundary in a `subgraph`; external ports live inside
      the subgraph as `((port))` round nodes so EIC / EOC read naturally. }}
# {{class_name}} — Block Diagram

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph {{class_name}}[" {{class_name}} : Coupled "]
        direction LR
        {{#each external_input_ports}}
        {{this.name}}_in(({{this.name}}))
        {{/each}}
        {{#each external_output_ports}}
        {{this.name}}_out(({{this.name}}))
        {{/each}}
        {{#each children}}
        {{var_name}}["{{var_name}} : {{class_name}}"]
        {{/each}}

        %% EIC (external input -> child input)
        {{#each eic_couplings}}
        {{from_port}}_in --> |{{to_port}}| {{to_child}}
        {{/each}}

        %% IC (child output -> child input)
        {{#each ic_couplings}}
        {{from_child}} --> |{{from_port}} -> {{to_port}}| {{to_child}}
        {{/each}}

        %% EOC (child output -> external output)
        {{#each eoc_couplings}}
        {{from_child}} --> |{{from_port}}| {{to_port}}_out
        {{/each}}
    end
```

